! x3270 4.5 X resource file. UMS Keymap resource name: ums
! Add these bindings on top of the built-in base keymap.
! Right Ctrl sends Enter; Ctrl+F1 sends PF13. Edit to suit your users.
! The literal \n and trailing backslash are part of X resource syntax.
x3270.keymap.ums: \
    <Key>Control_R: Enter() \n\
    Ctrl<Key>F1: PF(13)
